{
 "_about": [
  "Every 3D model in CWG3 is listed here, one line each. tools/bake_models.py reads this file and packs every model into assets/art/models.js (base64, so play.html works by double-click).",
  "src   : file under assets/models/src/ (.glb or .gltf).",
  "norm  : 'meters' = keep the model's real size (our own models; the game scales metres to pixels); 'height' = scale to height 1; 'length' = scale to length 1 along X.",
  "colors: material name -> palette key (assets/models/palette.json) or [r,g,b]. Materials not listed use the palette entry of the same name, else grey.",
  "ao    : true = darken toward the ground + tiny per-face colour variation (hand-made look). Use for buildings.",
  "credit: key into 'sources' below. Only CC0 or our own work, unless John approves otherwise (log CC-BY authors here if he does).",
  "preview_m: rough real height in metres, used only by tools/model_gallery.html for normalised models.",
  "patterns: optional {material: pattern id} for kit models (palette '_patterns' covers our own models). Our .glb files may carry chimney points in node extras.smoke (baked as 'smoke')."
 ],
